态时，《抽1张卡》（从我方的卡组上方抽取1张卡牌）。","security":"","image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262935EX4-007.png","officialId":3134,"form":"成熟期","attribute":"疫苗种","types":"恐龙型","originalModel":"EX4-007","cnProductCode":"BTC-07","variants":[{"model":"EX4-007","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3134,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262935EX4-007.png"}]},"EX4-008":{"name":"黑古拉兽","effect":"进化：<名称中包含“基尔兽”的Lv.3>起2\n\n【进化时】丢弃双方卡组最上方的2张卡牌。此后，可以从我方的废弃区中，将1张“基尔兽”，或1张名称中包含“古拉兽”或“公爵兽”的卡牌放回到手牌中。","inherited":"【消灭时】可以从我方的废弃区中，将1张“基尔兽”，或1张名称中包含“古拉兽”或“公爵兽”的卡牌放回到手牌中。","security":"","image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262935EX4-008.png","officialId":3135,"form":"成熟期","attribute":"病毒种","types":"魔龙型","originalModel":"EX4-008","cnProductCode":"BTC-07","variants":[{"model":"EX4-008","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3135,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262935EX4-008.png"}]},"EX4-009":{"name":"跃升暴龙兽","effect":"进化：“大地暴龙兽”起3\n\n【进化时】本回合中，对方1只数码宝贝和对方所有安防数码宝贝的DP-4000。","inherited":"【我方的回合】[每回合1次]当我方的红色或黄色驯兽师转换为休息状态时，本回合中，对方1只数码宝贝和对方所有安防数码宝贝的DP-4000。","security":"","image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262936EX4-009.png","officialId":3136,"form":"完全体","attribute":"疫苗种","types":"改造型","originalModel":"EX4-009","cnProductCode":"BTC-07","variants":[{"model":"EX4-009","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3136,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262936EX4-009.png"}]},"EX4-010":{"name":"黑大古拉兽","effect":"进化：<名称中包含“古拉兽”的Lv.4>起3\n\n【进化时】丢弃双方卡组最上方的3张卡牌。此后，选择对方DP合计不高于3000的数码宝贝，消灭所有被选中的数码宝贝。双方的废弃区中合计每有10张卡牌，此DP消灭效果的上限+2000。","inherited":"","security":"","image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262936EX4-010.png","officialId":3137,"form":"完全体","attribute":"病毒种","types":"改造型","originalModel":"EX4-010","cnProductCode":"BTC-07","variants":[{"model":"EX4-010","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3137,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262936EX4-010.png"}]},"EX4-011":{"name":"混沌公爵兽","effect":"进化：<名称中包含“大古拉兽”的Lv.5>起3\n\n[废弃区]【我方的回合结束时】可消灭我方1只拥有进化源且名称中包含“公爵兽”的数码宝贝，并可以不支付费用登场此卡牌。\n\n【登场时】消灭对方1只DP不高于7000的数码宝贝。双方的废弃区中合计每有10张卡牌，此DP消灭效果的上限+2000。","inherited":"","security":"","image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262936EX4-011.png","officialId":3138,"form":"究极体","attribute":"病毒种","types":"黑暗骑士型","originalModel":"EX4-011","cnProductCode":"BTC-07","variants":[{"model":"EX4-011","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3138,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262936EX4-011.png"},{"model":"EX4-011_01","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3139,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262936EX4-011_01.png"}]},"EX4-012":{"name":"胜利暴龙兽","effect":"【进化时】消灭对方1只DP不高于6000的数码宝贝。对方的场上每存在1只数码宝贝，此DP消灭效果的上限+2000。\n\n【双方的回合】［每回合1次］当对方的数码宝贝被消灭时，若我方的场上存在驯兽师，则消灭对方1只DP最高的数码宝贝。","inherited":"","security":"","image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262936EX4-012.png","officialId":3140,"form":"究极体","attribute":"疫苗种","types":"龙人型","originalModel":"EX4-012","cnProductCode":"BTC-07","variants":[{"model":"EX4-012","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3140,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262936EX4-012.png"},{"model":"EX4-012_01","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3141,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262936EX4-012_01.png"}]},"EX4-013":{"name":"中世纪公爵兽","effect":"【安防】不进行战斗，不支付费用登场此卡牌。当本回合结束时，将此数码宝贝放回到手牌中。\n\n【登场时】【攻击时】消灭对方1只DP不高于6000的数码宝贝。若通过此效果没有消灭对方的数码宝贝，则将对方的1只数码宝贝转换为休息状态，该数码宝贝在下个对方的激活阶段中无法转换为活跃状态。","inherited":"","security":"","image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262937EX4-013.png","officialId":3142,"form":"究极体","attribute":"数据种","types":"战士型","originalModel":"EX4-013","cnProductCode":"BTC-07","variants":[{"model":"EX4-013","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3142,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262937EX4-013.png"},{"model":"EX4-013_01","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3143,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262937EX4-013_01.png"}]},"EX4-014":{"name":"气龙兽","effect":"【我方的回合】［每回合1次］当拥有“蓝色闪耀”特征的卡牌登场时，《抽1张卡》（从我方的卡组上方抽取1张卡牌）。当拥有“黑军”特征的卡牌登场时，从我方的废弃区中，将1张拥有数码合体条件的数码宝贝卡牌放回到手牌中。\n\n※此卡不属于名称中包含“龙兽”的数码宝贝\n\n※此卡属于名称中包含“加奥”的数码宝贝","inherited":"","security":"","image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262937EX4-014.png","officialId":3144,"form":"成长期","attribute":"病毒种","types":"爬虫类型/蓝色闪耀","originalModel":"EX4-014","cnProductCode":"BTC-07","variants":[{"model":"EX4-014","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3144,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262937EX4-014.png"}]},"EX4-015":{"name":"加奥兽","effect":"【登场时】双方各从卡组上方抽取1张卡牌。","inherited":"【我方的回合】[每回合1次]当对方的手牌因效果而增加时，内存值+1。","security":"","image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262937EX4-015.png","officialId":3145,"form":"成长期","attribute":"数据种","types":"兽型","originalModel":"EX4-015","cnProductCode":"BTC-07","variants":[{"model":"EX4-015","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3145,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262937EX4-015.png"}]},"EX4-016":{"name":"暴龙兽","effect":"【登场时】翻开我方卡组最上方的3张卡牌。将其中1张“苍沼切羽”和1张蓝色或黑色且拥有数码合体条件的卡牌加入手牌。剩余的卡牌丢弃。\n\n【消灭时】《保存》（可以将此卡牌置于我方驯兽师的下方）","inherited":"【攻击时】《抽1张卡》（从我方的卡组上方抽取1张卡牌）","security":"","image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262937EX4-016.png","officialId":3146,"form":"成熟期","attribute":"病毒种","types":"恐龙型/蓝色闪耀","originalModel":"EX4-016","cnProductCode":"BTC-07","variants":[{"model":"EX4-016","productCode":"BTC-07","officialId":3146,"image":"https://yugioh-1258002530.file.myqcloud.com/dtcg/Picture/1696923262937EX4-016.png"}]},"EX4-017":{"name":"